Dialogue: 3,0:23:19.46,0:23:22.51,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}自指縫間滑落
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.51,0:23:25.51,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我試圖去理解
Dialogue: 3,0:23:27.68,0:23:29.35,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如缺失的線索
Dialogue: 3,0:23:29.35,0:23:30.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我沉溺的海洋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.93,0:23:32.47,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如舊鞋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:32.47,0:23:35.60,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如那場讓我遇見你的旅程
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.19,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如樹莓汁
Dialogue: 3,0:23:37.19,0:23:38.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我心境
Dialogue: 3,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}現在 你去往了何處？
Dialogue: 3,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我曾如此了解你
Dialogue: 3,0:23:50.45,0:23:52.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,0)}你去往了何處？
